# Line endings (OPS-07). The repository has always stored LF; this makes it the rule for every clone, so Git stops
# warning "LF will be replaced by CRLF" on Windows and the files match what CI and the Linux container read.
# Nothing was renormalized: the index already held LF for every text file.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never converted or diffed as text
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.ico   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.docx  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
